1
00:00:00,724 --> 00:00:03,434
Penny. Penny. Penny.

2
00:00:03,602 --> 00:00:06,692
PENNY:
Oh, for God's sakes, I'm in the bathroom.

3
00:00:06,855 --> 00:00:09,355
(Sheldon:)Shall I come back at a better time?

4
00:00:10,317 --> 00:00:12,777
PENNY:
Get in here!

5
00:00:13,111 --> 00:00:14,901
(Penny:)Hurry!

6
00:00:16,072 --> 00:00:18,202
(Penny:)Don't you dare knock.

7
00:00:22,078 --> 00:00:23,868
(Sheldon:)Hello.

8
00:00:24,039 --> 00:00:26,789
(Penny:)I slipped in the shower.
I think I dislocated my shoulder.

9
00:00:27,959 --> 00:00:29,129
(Sheldon:)Not surprising.

10
00:00:29,294 --> 00:00:31,464
(Sheldon:)You have no safety mat
or adhesive stickers...

11
00:00:31,630 --> 00:00:35,880
(Sheldon:)...to allow for purchase on a surface
with a low coefficient of static friction.

12
00:00:36,593 --> 00:00:37,973
(Penny:)What?

13
00:00:38,386 --> 00:00:40,346
(Sheldon:)Tubs are slippery.

14
00:00:40,513 --> 00:00:42,643
(Penny:)I know. I slipped.

15
00:00:42,807 --> 00:00:46,727
(Sheldon:)I have a series of whimsical duck stickers
on the bottom of my tub.

16
00:00:46,895 --> 00:00:49,685
(Penny:)Whatever. Will you just
turn the water off and help me up?

17
00:00:50,982 --> 00:00:53,442
SHELDON: They're holding umbrellas.
-Unh.

18
00:00:53,860 --> 00:00:56,070
(Penny:)-What?
-The ducks in my tub.

19
00:00:56,238 --> 00:00:57,318
Unh. Uh-huh.

20
00:00:57,489 --> 00:01:00,199
(Sheldon:)They're whimsical,
because ducks have neither a need for...

